 const int resultWords=nc*(productDegree+1);Row result(5*resultWords);auto binomial=[](int n,int k){int a=1;for(int j=1;j<=k;j++)a=a*(n-j+1)/j;return a;};
 for(int target=0;target<nt;target++){int j=target+2;for(int a=0;a<=j;a++)for(int b=a;b<=j;b++){int exponent=2*j-a-b,coefficient=binomial(j,a)*binomial(j,b)*(a==b?1:2)*(exponent%2?-1:1);coefficient=(coefficient%31+31)%31;int c=component.at(variable[a]+variable[b]);for(int d=0;d<=hd;d++){int value=(31-coefficient*h[d]%31)%31;int bit=(c*(productDegree+1)+exponent+d)*32+target;int old=BitOps::get(result,resultWords,bit),next=(old+value)%31;for(int plane=0;plane<5;plane++)result[plane*resultWords+bit/32]&=~(uint32_t(1)<<(bit%32));BitOps::set(result,resultWords,bit,next);}}}
